#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0252 expect=noViolation domain=ADAE
#note "A conformant occurrence dataset: ASEV, ASEVN and AOCCFL are legitimate OCCDS variables (they sit in sibling -D's BDS-partition prohibition, not this parent's), and no column name is in the 28-name membership list or matches any of the 13 family regexes. Since Fix #270 (ruling M2-D3) the wildcard-free Check EXECUTES per variable and stays silent -> the rule's first true noViolation state; pre-#270 the rule could only report SKIPPED here (NoMatch dropped it, the recorded carve-out per ruling M2-PMDA-T1-K1-01, now retired for this family)."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#expectViolationCount 0
dataset ADAE structure=OCCDS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col AEDECOD  type=Char
col ASEV     type=Char
col ASEVN    type=Num
col AOCCFL   type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE | MILD | 1 | Y
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | NAUSEA | MODERATE | 2 | N
